{"id": "community-challenge-grants", "title": "Grant chief charged with steering $1.4M to a contractor accused of paying her", "seconds": 130.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "92659975249e63a1", "words": 421, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "San Francisco’s Community Challenge Grants pay neighborhood groups for local improvements.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.6, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Community Challenge Grants", "sub": "City Administrator’s office"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.67, 1.07, 1.36, 1.67, 1.87, 2.26, 2.48, 2.62, 2.88]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "links[0]"], "text": "From 2011 to 2023, Lanita Henriquez ran the program.", "t0": 3.72, "t1": 7.08, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "program director, 2011 to 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.4, 0.7, 0.78, 1.03, 1.83, 2.16, 2.66, 2.84, 2.93]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "From 2016 to 2020, how much did she sign over to companies controlled by contractor Dwayne Jones?", "t0": 7.2, "t1": 13.13, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "July 2016 to July 2020", "sub": "contracts with companies run by Dwayne Jones"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 0.87, 1.02, 1.3, 1.99, 2.18, 2.39, 2.53, 2.68, 2.99, 3.17, 3.26, 3.64, 4.03, 4.18, 4.71, 5.0]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]", "amount"], "text": "Over 1.4 million dollars, prosecutors say. In 23 contracts.", "t0": 13.13, "t1": 17.53, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "over $1.4 million", "label": "in 23 contracts, prosecutors allege"}, "emph": ["Over"], "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.48, 0.7, 0.92, 1.21, 1.72, 2.26, 3.06, 3.23, 3.79]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "notEstablished[0]", "defense[0]", "defense[1]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction. Henriquez and Jones both pleaded not guilty.", "t0": 18.05, "t1": 22.56, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An allegation, not a conviction", "sub": "both pleaded not guilty, per the Controller, March 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.5, 0.59, 1.32, 1.49, 1.55, 2.45, 2.95, 3.07, 3.42, 3.65, 3.98, 4.15]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]", "links[3]"], "text": "The District Attorney says Jones’s companies wrote her nine checks, totalling 32,942 dollars.", "t0": 22.78, "t1": 28.02, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Dwayne Jones’s companies", "sub": "RDJ Enterprises and others"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "9 checks, $32,942"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Her relatives and associates", "sub": "48 checks, $156,821"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "emph": ["32,942"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.73, 0.96, 1.32, 1.69, 1.91, 2.03, 2.25, 2.83, 3.21, 3.65, 4.01, 4.21, 4.45, 4.89]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[4]"], "text": "And 48 more checks to her relatives and close associates. How much?", "t0": 28.14, "t1": 32.03, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Dwayne Jones’s companies", "sub": "RDJ Enterprises and others"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "9 checks, $32,942"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Her relatives and associates", "sub": "48 checks, $156,821"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 0.79, 1.05, 1.17, 1.28, 1.67, 1.76, 2.0, 2.97, 3.18]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "156,821 dollars.", "t0": 32.03, "t1": 34.58, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$156,821", "label": "to her family and close associates, alleged"}, "emph": ["156,821"], "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.43, 0.92, 1.33, 1.51, 1.72, 2.18]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "She chose who got the contracts.", "t0": 35.1, "t1": 36.52, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A financial interest", "sub": "she chose the recipient, and it paid her, prosecutors say"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.47, 0.6, 0.76, 0.85]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "State law bars an official from a contract she has a financial stake in.", "t0": 36.64, "t1": 39.73, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A financial interest", "sub": "she chose the recipient, and it paid her, prosecutors say"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.51, 0.75, 0.85, 1.17, 1.32, 1.39, 1.81, 1.97, 2.14, 2.21, 2.62, 2.91]}, {"scene": "checks", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Each was charged with misappropriation of public money, six counts of bribery and 23 conflict-of-interest counts.", "t0": 39.85, "t1": 45.26, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The charges, August 29, 2023", "sub": "each: misappropriation, 6 bribery counts, 23 conflict counts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.31, 0.59, 0.72, 1.5, 1.58, 1.88, 2.52, 2.78, 3.02, 3.08, 3.61, 3.81, 4.34, 5.05]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "timeline[7]"], "text": "In January 2024, a third person was charged: Stanley Ellicott, a City finance manager.", "t0": 45.48, "t1": 50.65, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Stanley Ellicott", "kicker": "A third man", "sub": "finance manager, Department of Human Resources"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.62, 0.85, 1.63, 1.76, 2.01, 2.28, 2.39, 3.12, 3.49, 4.04, 4.15, 4.4, 4.79]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]", "links[5]"], "text": "Prosecutors say Jones’s firm paid him 269,876.24 dollars.", "t0": 50.77, "t1": 55.91, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "RDJ Enterprises", "sub": "Jones’s company"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Stanley Ellicott", "sub": "$269,876.24, a City finance manager"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "$65,650.26 by Venmo and PayPal"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.75, 1.1, 1.34, 1.5, 1.61, 1.79, 2.05, 2.55, 2.94, 3.14, 3.38, 3.92, 4.25, 4.36, 4.79]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]", "links[5]"], "text": "How much did he pass back to Henriquez?", "t0": 56.03, "t1": 58.19, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "RDJ Enterprises", "sub": "Jones’s company"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Stanley Ellicott", "sub": "$269,876.24, a City finance manager"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "$65,650.26 by Venmo and PayPal"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.32, 0.44, 0.54, 0.83, 1.05, 1.14]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]", "links[6]"], "text": "65,650.26 dollars.", "t0": 58.19, "t1": 61.25, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$65,650.26", "label": "by Venmo and PayPal, alleged"}, "emph": ["65,650.26"], "wt": [0.04, 0.62, 0.98, 1.19, 1.41, 1.68, 2.06, 2.26, 2.72]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Why the payment apps?", "t0": 61.77, "t1": 63.11, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "RDJ Enterprises", "sub": "Jones’s company"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Stanley Ellicott", "sub": "$269,876.24, a City finance manager"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "$65,650.26 by Venmo and PayPal"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.27, 0.57]}, {"scene": "relay", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Money through a third person’s account hides that the contractor is paying the official.", "t0": 63.11, "t1": 66.22, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "RDJ Enterprises", "sub": "Jones’s company"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Stanley Ellicott", "sub": "$269,876.24, a City finance manager"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "$65,650.26 by Venmo and PayPal"}], "kicker": "Alleged, from the arrest affidavit"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.27, 0.47, 0.53, 0.75, 1.05, 1.38, 1.63, 1.74, 1.84, 2.34, 2.44, 2.66, 2.77]}, {"scene": "quake", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "In 2019, Jones’s company billed a grant for nearly 14,000 dollars of earthquake supplies.", "t0": 66.44, "t1": 71.35, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Earthquake supplies", "kicker": "February and March 2019", "chip": "nearly $14,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 1.14, 1.52, 1.84, 2.08, 2.16, 2.45, 2.59, 2.87, 3.31, 3.68, 3.99, 4.08, 4.44]}, {"scene": "quake", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "They were Oculus headsets, cameras and tablets, the affidavit says. Most were later sold on eBay.", "t0": 71.47, "t1": 76.51, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the invoice", "earthquake supplies"], "b": ["the Best Buy items", "Oculus headsets, cameras, tablets"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.26, 0.67, 1.28, 1.62, 1.71, 2.25, 2.38, 2.87, 3.65, 3.89, 4.02, 4.27, 4.54, 4.66]}, {"scene": "quake", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why", "links[7]"], "text": "It also alleges more than 100,000 dollars of emergency equipment, invoiced, approved, and never bought.", "t0": 76.63, "t1": 82.09, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Never bought", "kicker": "Alleged", "chip": "more than $100,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.79, 0.96, 1.12, 1.31, 1.57, 1.89, 2.19, 2.29, 2.7, 3.41, 4.04, 4.72, 4.93, 5.2]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[4]", "links[8]"], "text": "Ellicott also stole 627,118.86 dollars from the City’s workers’ comp fund,", "t0": 82.31, "t1": 87.8, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$627,118.86", "label": "taken from the workers’ compensation fund", "sub": "through a fake vendor, IAG Services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.69, 0.94, 1.13, 1.35, 1.86, 2.23, 2.37, 2.59, 2.92, 3.22, 3.32, 3.73, 3.94, 4.06, 4.16, 4.43, 4.73, 4.96]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[3]", "established[4]", "links[8]"], "text": "through a fake vendor, IAG Services.", "t0": 87.8, "t1": 89.82, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$627,118.86", "label": "taken from the workers’ compensation fund", "sub": "through a fake vendor, IAG Services"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.32, 0.56, 1.07, 1.56]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "timeline[11]", "established[13]", "established[15]"], "text": "That part is proven. Ellicott pleaded guilty and got three years in state prison.", "t0": 89.94, "t1": 93.5, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "January 5, 2026", "sub": "Ellicott: three years in state prison"}, "emph": ["proven"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.37, 0.47, 1.23, 1.66, 1.94, 2.22, 2.32, 2.48, 2.71, 2.93, 3.03, 3.25]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[10]", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "In 2026, the court ordered restitution paid from his frozen accounts. The register gives no amount.", "t0": 93.62, "t1": 98.71, "shot": "b18b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Restitution", "kicker": "Ellicott’s register", "sub": "paid from frozen accounts, 2026-02-19; no amount given"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.39, 1.12, 1.27, 1.48, 1.7, 2.28, 2.49, 2.61, 2.73, 3.03, 3.79, 3.94, 4.35, 4.59, 4.75]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "The Controller found Henriquez gave Jones’s firms 22 grants and one services contract.", "t0": 98.83, "t1": 103.05, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "The 2023 grant round", "sub": "22 grant agreements and 1 services agreement, 2016 to 2020"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.52, 0.73, 1.24, 1.44, 1.82, 2.12, 2.59, 2.98, 3.2, 3.41, 3.79]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "And she faked applicants’ scores in 2023.", "t0": 103.17, "t1": 105.32, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "The 2023 grant round", "sub": "22 grant agreements and 1 services agreement, 2016 to 2020"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.29, 0.58, 0.95, 1.29, 1.37, 1.62]}, {"scene": "done", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]", "timeline[5]"], "text": "The City suspended Jones and five of his companies in September 2023.", "t0": 105.44, "t1": 108.85, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Suspended", "sub": "Jones and five entities, since Sept 7, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.4, 0.86, 1.16, 1.27, 1.5, 1.58, 1.7, 2.1, 2.2, 2.63, 2.87]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[4]", "notEstablished[4]", "timeline[12]"], "text": "So where is Jones’s case? The City still lists him suspended pending the criminal case.", "t0": 109.07, "t1": 112.95, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["City list, June 30, 2026", "pending criminal case"], "b": ["District Attorney dataset", "Discharged"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.4, 0.49, 0.86, 1.42, 1.56, 1.8, 2.05, 2.27, 2.42, 2.89, 3.16, 3.25, 3.56]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["story[4]", "notEstablished[4]", "timeline[12]"], "text": "A District Attorney dataset says Discharged.", "t0": 113.07, "t1": 115.16, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["City list, June 30, 2026", "pending criminal case"], "b": ["District Attorney dataset", "Discharged"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0